rward to visiting the Kremlin.</br>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Isn't there a wall there? You have to send me photos!</br>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah, it encircles the Kremlin. Well, you must read my blog posts!</br>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I can't keep up with those.</br>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Vanessa, how's your foot?</br>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Still using crutches. </br>", "time": "37000", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 2}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Sally in China", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Bye Bye, China!", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Delicious Food > China", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 16, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "calm your nerves", "type": "name"}, {"content": "use to say someone should relax and not worry ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Make sure to calm your nerves before the interview.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le16ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Chinese", "type": "name"}, {"content": "relating to China", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You could make a Chinese dish.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le16ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "authentic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "made in the traditional or original way ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I love authentic Chinese food!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le16ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "capital city", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the city in a country where their government is ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The guards sent signals to the capital city. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le16ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to encircle", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to surround something completely ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The wall encircles the city. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le16ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Simple Past Tense ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you travel, you ask and report about things you see. You can use the Simple Past tense to report about things you see. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Remember, there are regular and irregular verbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ate lots of authentic Chinese food.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Wasn't there a wall there?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Must vs. Should", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use the modals must and should to give recommendations", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Must is a very strong recommendation. You can use have to instead of must. You can use have to when you speak. Should is not as strong. It is a suggestion.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You must visit the Kremlin! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You should make a Chinese dish. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You should take lots of photos!", "type": "example"}, {"content": " You have to try the local cuisine!", "type": "example"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le16ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Research on the Internet for a place or attraction in a country you want to visit.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Answer these questions: <ul><li>What country is it in?</li> <li>What is the name of the place or attraction? </li> <li>When was it built?</li> <li>Why was it built?</li> <li>Who built it?</li> <li>How far is it from your city?</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph of 7-8 sentences. Remember to include an introductory and concluding sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph aloud to your class.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify places in another country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I identify specific information to answer questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a paragraph from my research.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my paragraph about an attraction to a group.", "type": "text"}]}]}